1
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,350
Assistant Director Williams.

2
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,850
I know who you are.

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,010
Fisher.
Long time no see.

4
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,850
Stop looking.
You won't find me.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,670
I know about your case
against Lambert and me.

6
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,310
Well, after New York City,
you disappeared.

7
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,750
You went rogue.

8
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,670
But if you come in,
we can work something out.

9
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:29,470
No thanks.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,030
You've been after us
since this mission started.

11
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:36,410
I had to be. You and Lambert went
way over the line on this one.

12
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,910
Tens of thousands of lives were at stake.

13
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,210
Exactly.

14
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,730
And we have ways to go about these things.

15
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:46,700
But you and Lambert went off alone,

16
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:50,170
taking unnecessary risks
and making all kinds of blunders.

17
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,010
Starting with Iceland.

18
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:53,670
Remember?
